# Nothing to set: `npm run check`, `npm test` and `npm run demo` run 100% offline, $0, on a FAKE
# browser (no Chrome, no display, no internet); models are scripted. No key is needed.
#
# The live run (README §5): real Google Chrome, headed, a display, and a cheap OpenRouter model.
# Copy to .env only for `npm run demo:live`.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# The origins the browser may request (semicolon-separated); everything else is refused, redirects
# included. Default for a live run: https://example.org. Never list 127.0.0.1.
# BROWSER_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://example.org

# The application's PII pseudonym key: the demo uses a synthetic one.
# PII_PSEUDONYM_KEY=
